See README for the build commands and the Cargo feature matrix, rust/README.md for
the developer guide, Makefile.in for the nine targets rust, rust-pc, rust-test,
rust-symbols, rust-header, rust-simd, rust-inventory, rust-msrv and rust-clean,
and .github/workflows/rust.yml for the twenty-two jobs that gate them.
.github/scripts/ holds the gate programs those jobs invoke rather than inline:
bench_gate.py with its self-test and fixture, and whitespace_gate.sh.  The staged
symlink chain is verified instead by crates/libz-rs-sys/tests/dropin_chain.rs, a
test of the crate that produces the chain, so `cargo test' checks it too.
